## 1. Core concepts

Normain's access model building blocks:

- **Users** — individual KPMG people with Normain accounts.
- **Teams** — a defined set of users (comparable to a team in MS Teams).
- **Sites** — each team is connected to one or many SharePoint sites. Access is enforced at the **site** level, not the folder level.

A user sees files only on sites belonging to teams they are a member of.

